{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 8,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 441.34,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we had gathered together",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "start": 3.013,
      "end": 7.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all manner of seeds of every kind, both of grain of every kind,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.512,
      "end": 10.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of the seeds of fruit of every kind.",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 11.443,
      "end": 15.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that while my father tarried in the wilderness",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.245,
      "end": 17.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he spake unto us, saying:",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.283,
      "end": 21.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I have dreamed a dream; or, in other words, I have seen a vision.",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.607,
      "end": 25.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, because of the thing which I have seen,",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.038,
      "end": 31.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have reason to rejoice in the Lord, because of Nephi and also of Sam;",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.884,
      "end": 37.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have reason to suppose that they, and also many of their seed, will be saved.",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.905,
      "end": 39.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, Laman and Lemuel,",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.175,
      "end": 42.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I fear exceedingly because of you;",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 42.677,
      "end": 47.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, methought I saw in my dream, a dark and dreary wilderness.",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 48.28,
      "end": 50.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I saw a man,",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.875,
      "end": 53.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was dressed in a white robe;",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.191,
      "end": 55.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he came and stood before me.",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 56.239,
      "end": 58.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he spake unto me,",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.973,
      "end": 60.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bade me follow him.",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 61.325,
      "end": 63.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that as I followed him",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 64.152,
      "end": 65.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld myself",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 65.957,
      "end": 68.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I was in a dark and dreary waste.",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 69.47,
      "end": 72.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after I had traveled for the space of many hours in darkness,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 73.133,
      "end": 75.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I began to pray unto the Lord",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 75.589,
      "end": 80.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would have mercy on me, according to the multitude of his tender mercies.",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 80.959,
      "end": 84.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after I had prayed unto the Lord",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 84.436,
      "end": 86.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld a large and spacious field.",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 87.531,
      "end": 90.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld a tree,",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 90.219,
      "end": 92.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose fruit was desirable to make one happy.",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 93.639,
      "end": 96.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I did go forth",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 96.466,
      "end": 98.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the fruit thereof;",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 98.736,
      "end": 103.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I beheld that it was most sweet, above all that I ever before tasted.",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 104.164,
      "end": 107.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I beheld that the fruit thereof was white,",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 108.059,
      "end": 111.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to exceed all the whiteness that I had ever seen.",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 112.176,
      "end": 114.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as I partook of the fruit thereof",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 114.864,
      "end": 117.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it filled my soul with exceedingly great joy;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 118.016,
      "end": 122.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I began to be desirous that my family should partake of it also;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 123.165,
      "end": 126.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I knew that it was desirable above all other fruit.",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 127.235,
      "end": 129.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as I cast my eyes round about,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 129.83,
      "end": 133.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps I might discover my family also,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 133.4,
      "end": 135.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld a river of water;",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 135.67,
      "end": 137.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it ran along,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 137.336,
      "end": 140.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was near the tree of which I was partaking the fruit.",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 141.081,
      "end": 143.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked to behold from whence it came;",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 144.094,
      "end": 147.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw the head thereof a little way off;",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 147.664,
      "end": 150.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and at the head thereof I beheld your mother Sariah,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 150.863,
      "end": 152.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Sam, and Nephi;",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 152.808,
      "end": 156.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they stood as if they knew not whither they should go.",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 156.832,
      "end": 160.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beckoned unto them;",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 160.263,
      "end": 163.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I also did say unto them with a loud voice",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 163.554,
      "end": 165.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should come unto me,",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 165.592,
      "end": 170.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the fruit, which was desirable above all other fruit.",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 171.288,
      "end": 174.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did come unto me",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 174.254,
      "end": 176.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the fruit also.",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 177.163,
      "end": 182.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I was desirous that Laman and Lemuel should come",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 182.869,
      "end": 184.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the fruit also;",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 185.046,
      "end": 188.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I cast mine eyes towards the head of the river,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 188.616,
      "end": 190.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps I might see them.",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 191.386,
      "end": 193.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I saw them,",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 193.795,
      "end": 196.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they would not come unto me",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 196.204,
      "end": 197.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the fruit.",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 198.509,
      "end": 200.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I beheld a rod of iron,",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 200.779,
      "end": 203.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it extended along the bank of the river,",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 203.745,
      "end": 206.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and led to the tree by which I stood.",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 206.793,
      "end": 209.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also beheld a strait and narrow path,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 209.945,
      "end": 214.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which came along by the rod of iron, even to the tree by which I stood;",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 215.141,
      "end": 218.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it also led by the head of the fountain,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 218.34,
      "end": 222.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto a large and spacious field, as if it had been a world.",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 223.339,
      "end": 226.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I saw numberless concourses of people,",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 226.213,
      "end": 228.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many of whom were pressing forward,",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 228.622,
      "end": 233.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might obtain the path which led unto the tree by which I stood.",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 233.992,
      "end": 236.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did come forth,",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 236.819,
      "end": 239.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and commence in the path which led to the tree.",
      "verse": "8:22",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 240.378,
      "end": 247.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there arose a mist of darkness; yea, even an exceedingly great mist of darkness,",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 247.431,
      "end": 252.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they who had commenced in the path did lose their way,",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 252.209,
      "end": 254.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they wandered off and were lost.",
      "verse": "8:23",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 255.304,
      "end": 259.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld others pressing forward,",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 259.385,
      "end": 263.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they came forth and caught hold of the end of the rod of iron;",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 263.884,
      "end": 267.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did press forward through the mist of darkness,",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 267.454,
      "end": 269.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "clinging to the rod of iron,",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 269.631,
      "end": 271.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until they did come forth",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 271.808,
      "end": 274.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the fruit of the tree.",
      "verse": "8:24",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 274.903,
      "end": 278.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they had partaken of the fruit of the tree",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 278.241,
      "end": 281.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did cast their eyes about as if they were ashamed.",
      "verse": "8:25",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 282.218,
      "end": 284.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also cast my eyes round about,",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 284.534,
      "end": 287.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and beheld, on the other side of the river of water,",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 288.104,
      "end": 290.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a great and spacious building;",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 290.42,
      "end": 292.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it stood as it were in the air,",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 292.69,
      "end": 294.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "high above the earth.",
      "verse": "8:26",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 294.995,
      "end": 297.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it was filled with people,",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 297.358,
      "end": 299.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both old and young,",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 299.303,
      "end": 301.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both male and female;",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 301.341,
      "end": 304.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their manner of dress was exceedingly fine;",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 304.54,
      "end": 309.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were in the attitude of mocking and pointing their fingers",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 309.643,
      "end": 313.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "towards those who had come at and were partaking of the fruit.",
      "verse": "8:27",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 314.456,
      "end": 321.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they had tasted of the fruit they were ashamed, because of those that were scoffing at them;",
      "verse": "8:28",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 321.463,
      "end": 325.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they fell away into forbidden paths and were lost.",
      "verse": "8:28",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 325.765,
      "end": 329.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, do not speak all the words of my father.",
      "verse": "8:29",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 329.928,
      "end": 331.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, to be short in writing,",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 332.012,
      "end": 335.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he saw other multitudes pressing forward;",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 335.536,
      "end": 339.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they came and caught hold of the end of the rod of iron;",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 339.292,
      "end": 341.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did press their way forward,",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 341.887,
      "end": 344.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "continually holding fast to the rod of iron,",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 345.178,
      "end": 347.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they came forth and fell down",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 347.68,
      "end": 350.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partook of the fruit of the tree.",
      "verse": "8:30",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 350.961,
      "end": 353.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also saw other multitudes",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 353.463,
      "end": 357.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "feeling their way towards that great and spacious building.",
      "verse": "8:31",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 358.044,
      "end": 362.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that many were drowned in the depths of the fountain;",
      "verse": "8:32",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 362.404,
      "end": 366.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many were lost from his view, wandering in strange roads.",
      "verse": "8:32",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 367.171,
      "end": 369.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And great was the multitude",
      "verse": "8:33",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 369.255,
      "end": 371.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that did enter into that strange building.",
      "verse": "8:33",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 372.082,
      "end": 374.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they did enter into that building",
      "verse": "8:33",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 374.909,
      "end": 377.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did point the finger of scorn at me",
      "verse": "8:33",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 377.597,
      "end": 380.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those that were partaking of the fruit also;",
      "verse": "8:33",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 380.842,
      "end": 382.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we heeded them not.",
      "verse": "8:33",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 383.008,
      "end": 385.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "These are the words of my father:",
      "verse": "8:34",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 385.556,
      "end": 388.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For as many as heeded them, had fallen away.",
      "verse": "8:34",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 389.115,
      "end": 393.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Laman and Lemuel partook not of the fruit, said my father.",
      "verse": "8:35",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 393.928,
      "end": 396.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after my father had spoken",
      "verse": "8:36",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 397.127,
      "end": 399.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all the words of his dream or vision,",
      "verse": "8:36",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 399.954,
      "end": 401.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were many,",
      "verse": "8:36",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 401.434,
      "end": 405.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he said unto us, because of these things which he saw in a vision,",
      "verse": "8:36",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 405.794,
      "end": 408.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he exceedingly feared for Laman and Lemuel;",
      "verse": "8:36",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 408.807,
      "end": 413.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he feared lest they should be cast off from the presence of the Lord.",
      "verse": "8:36",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 414.27,
      "end": 418.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did exhort them then with all the feeling of a tender parent,",
      "verse": "8:37",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 418.676,
      "end": 421.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would hearken to his words,",
      "verse": "8:37",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 421.317,
      "end": 424.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that perhaps the Lord would be merciful to them,",
      "verse": "8:37",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 424.423,
      "end": 425.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not cast them off;",
      "verse": "8:37",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 426.136,
      "end": 428.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, my father did preach unto them.",
      "verse": "8:37",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 428.999,
      "end": 431.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he had preached unto them,",
      "verse": "8:38",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 431.408,
      "end": 434.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also prophesied unto them of many things,",
      "verse": "8:38",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 434.746,
      "end": 437.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he bade them to keep the commandments of the Lord;",
      "verse": "8:38",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 437.991,
      "end": 440.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did cease speaking unto them.",
      "verse": "8:38",
      "lineIndex": 135
    }
  ]
}